{"uid":"src/hostedit.c::he_suggest","name":"he_suggest","qualname":"he_suggest","kind":"function","file":"src/hostedit.c","line":164,"end_line":171,"language":"c","signature":"int he_suggest(const char *text, const char *query, char results[][HE_MAX_HOST + 1], int max)","params":[{"name":"text","annotation":"char *","default":"","kind":"positional"},{"name":"query","annotation":"char *","default":"","kind":"positional"},{"name":"HE_MAX_HOST","annotation":"char results[][ + 1]","default":"","kind":"positional"},{"name":"max","annotation":"int","default":"","kind":"positional"}],"returns":"int","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Omnibar autocomplete: treats allow.conf (a hosts-format text) as a favorites list.","description":"Fills results[0..max) with up to max distinct domain tokens of text that match query case-insensitively -- PREFIX matches first (document order), then non-prefix SUBSTRING matches. query \"\" matches everything (favorites browsing). Each result is lowercased and NUL-terminated; hosts longer than HE_MAX_HOST are skipped. results is a caller array results[max][HE_MAX_HOST+1]. Returns the count written. Pure (no allocation, no I/O). NULL args / max <= 0 -> 0.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[["Inherited","Documentation from `he_suggest` (include/hostedit.h:55)."]],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"src/hostedit.c","members":[],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
